# Copy to .env and fill in the keys for plugins you actually run.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# No shipped plugin (username-enum, http-security-headers,
# metadata-extractor) requires an API key today. The entries below are for
# the sensitive, API-key-gated plugins planned for v1.0
# (see ORWELL_OSINT_PLAN.md) — uncomment/rename as those land.
#
# Naming convention (core/config-manager.js): ORWELL_<PLUGIN_ID>_API_KEY,
# with the plugin id upper-cased and hyphens turned into underscores.

# ORWELL_WIGLE_GEOLOCATION_API_KEY=
# ORWELL_SHODAN_LOOKUP_API_KEY=
